From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: use vscodium policy-watcher fork and own org namespace for policies

Upstream's `@vscode/policy-watcher` hard-codes the `Software\Policies\Microsoft` registry key and the `Microsoft` ADMX/MDM namespace, so VSCodium swaps in its `@vscodium/policy-watcher` fork whose watcher factory takes the vendor name as an argument and templates the org through `!!ORG_NAME!!`, letting group-policy and managed-settings lookups resolve under VSCodium's own namespace instead of Microsoft's (#2209, #2716).

